{"5449190":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Lake of Darkness: Cide Story","steam_appid":5449190,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5449190\/extras\/8cc0c147cd54332f2e58cd6021106512.avif?t=1793658318\" width=480 height=480 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casey will not survive to see tomorrow. The clock is ticking in this emotional psychological horror visual novel. The endings differ, but your fate is always the same.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this prequel to Lake of Darkness discover mind-bending truths and the secrets of the people around you. There are some depths better left unknown.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game ties in heavily to the first however you do not need to have played Lake of Darkness to enjoy Lake of Darkness: Cide Story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only a single day remains, you must make the most of it. <\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to wake up Casey.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unlockable steam achievements<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 discoverable endings<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 minigames<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectables<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack with 16 atmospheric songs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many secrets and scares<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar evil encroaches upon the town, you only have the one day left.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and find solace in the trial ahead. After all, we're all a part of something greater.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absolutely no generative ai was using during the creation of this game.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5449190\/extras\/8cc0c147cd54332f2e58cd6021106512.avif?t=1793658318\" width=480 height=480 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casey will not survive to see tomorrow. The clock is ticking in this emotional psychological horror visual novel. The endings differ, but your fate is always the same.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this prequel to Lake of Darkness discover mind-bending truths and the secrets of the people around you. There are some depths better left unknown.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game ties in heavily to the first however you do not need to have played Lake of Darkness to enjoy Lake of Darkness: Cide Story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only a single day remains, you must make the most of it. <\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to wake up Casey.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unlockable steam achievements<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 discoverable endings<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 minigames<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectables<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack with 16 atmospheric songs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many secrets and scares<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar evil encroaches upon the town, you only have the one day left.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and find solace in the trial ahead. After all, we're all a part of something greater.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absolutely no generative ai was using during the creation of this game.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Lake of Darkness: Cide Story is a choice based psychological horror visual novel in which you live through the final day of a girl in a small town learning what strange fate becomes of her. You can try your best but Casey won't survive.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5449190\/505e4d533374b4a58052a0888cbbc860e357598f\/header.jpg?t=1793658318","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5449190\/45a794e263d196f0a38d4bfad6743e2226d4ec5c\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793658318","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5449190\/45a794e263d196f0a38d4bfad6743e2226d4ec5c\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793658318","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.0<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 250 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Steeze Games"],"publishers":["Steeze Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":289,"final":289,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"2,89€"},"packages":[1880520],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Lake of Darkness: Cide Story","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1880520,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Lake of Darkness: Cide Story - 2,89€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_i